<rml>
<head>
<title>Odjazdy</title>
<!--
Example (TSRE displays): a station's departures board.

Shape: ORB_Tpo4.sd. Its texture ORB_Tpo_ODJAZDY.ACE is replaced by this
document, the whole texture (512 x 1024), Surface Paper, Input Station.

Shows the board's face and the station's departures (display.departures).
Each row:
- the time, and the delay where the train is late;
- the destination: the train's own (#tsre.destination in the timetable),
  else the station of its last stop on the route;
- a train-type pictogram: the user's key #tsre.extra.kind (fast, regional,
  aglo) picks the picture rodzaj_pociagu_<kind>.png from the route's
  TEXTURES;
- the train: its operator, category, number, line and name where the
  timetable has them (#tsre.<field> rows), else its timetable name;
- the platform.

Data binding only.
-->
<style>
body, div {
    display: block;
}
span {
    display: inline-block;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #2f3a44;
    font-family: Noto Sans;
}

/* The board's own face, painted around the poster. */
#header {
    position: absolute;
    left: 6%;
    top: 3%;
}
.title {
    color: #f2c200;
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.english {
    color: #f2c200;
    font-size: 28px;
}
#footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 78%;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    color: #8d99a6;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* The poster: the station's name and the rows. */
#poster {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10%;
    top: 16.6%;
    width: 84%;
    height: 53%;
    padding: 8px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #13358f;
}
.station {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.row {
    margin-top: 3px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    background-color: #f4f1e6;
    color: #101010;
    font-size: 16px;
}
.time {
    width: 52px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.kind {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
}
.place {
    font-weight: bold;
}
.delay {
    margin-left: 6px;
    color: #c01818;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.details {
    color: #404040;
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.train {
    width: 70%;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.operator {
    margin-right: 4px;
    padding: 1px 3px;
    background-color: #13358f;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.code {
    color: #101010;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.platform {
    width: 30%;
    text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body data-model="display">

<div id="header">
    <div class="title">Odjazdy</div>
    <div class="english">Departures</div>
</div>

<div id="poster">
    <div class="station">{{station}}</div>
    <div data-for="row, i : departures">
        <div class="row" data-if="i &lt; 11">
            <div>
                <span class="time">{{row.time}}</span>
                <img class="kind"
                     data-if="row.extra.kind != ''"
                     data-attr-src="'rodzaj_pociagu_' + row.extra.kind + '.png'"/>
                <span class="place">{{row.destination}}</span>
                <span class="delay" data-if="row.delay != ''">+{{row.delay}} min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="details">
                <!-- The train's fields where it has them, else its timetable name. -->
                <span class="train" data-if="row.operator != '' || row.category != '' || row.line != ''">
                    <span class="operator" data-if="row.operator != ''">{{row.operator}}</span>
                    <span class="code">{{row.category}} {{row.number}} {{row.line}}</span>
                    {{row.name}}
                </span>
                <span class="train" data-if="row.operator == '' &amp;&amp; row.category == '' &amp;&amp; row.line == ''">{{row.id}}</span>
                <span class="platform">{{row.platform}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="footer">PKP POLSKIE LINIE KOLEJOWE S.A.</div>

</body>
</rml>
